<title>UK: Morocco seeks 50,000 tonnes soft wheat - exporters.</title>
<headline>Morocco seeks 50,000 tonnes soft wheat - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco has launched a tender for the purchase of 50,000 tonnes of optional soft wheat, European grain exporters told Reuters.</p>
<p>Morocco is seeking the wheat in two shipments of 25,000 tonnes each, they said. Details of a shipment date were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Exporters said the wheat was likely to come from the United States or Canada but that French wheat could not be ruled out.</p>
</text>
